          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Method: Data on collected waste in terms of weight as well as warnings issued were provided by the Tilburg Department of Sanitation (BAT). Survey data are based on an online survey among 10,000 households (invited by way of a letter) conducted in April, 2015.\n<br><br><p>Universe: 70,000 households that live in single-family homes serviced by curbside collection in the Tilburg area.</p>\n<p>Country / Nation: The Netherlands</p>\nThe two dta files are also available in their preferred file format. Preferred formats \tare file formats of which DANS – based on international agreements – is confident that they offer the best long-term guarantees in terms of usability, accessibility and sustainability. For more information on preferred file formats, see <a href=https://dans.knaw.nl/en/file-formats>https://dans.knaw.nl/en/file-formats</a>."
          },
